<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HYDERABAD, India 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the</p>
<p>opening match of the Titan Cup triangular limited-over series</p>
<p>between India and South Africa at Hyderabad's Lal Bahadur</p>
<p>Stadium on Thursday:</p>
<p>South Africa</p>
<p> A.Hudson c Azharuddin b Prasad     34</p>
<p> G.Kirsten c Azharuddin b Kumble    84</p>
<p> P.Symcox b Kumble			 3</p>
<p> D.Cullinan c Prasad b Joshi	  16</p>
<p> J.Rhodes c and b Jadeja		10</p>
<p> H.Cronje not out			 63</p>
<p> D.Crookes b Kumble			2</p>
<p> B.McMillan run out		     32</p>
<p> D.Richardson not out		    9</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4 n-2 w-2)		   8</p>
<p>Total (for 7 wickets in 50 overs) 261</p>
<p>Did not bat: F. de Viliers, A.Donald.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-74 2-85 3-128 4-145 5-158 6-166 7-242</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 9-1-45-0 (2nb), Prasad 10-0-45-1 (1w),</p>
<p>Joshi 10-0-64-1 (1w), Kumble 10-0-42-3, Tendulkar 5-0-28-0,</p>
<p>Jadeja 6-0-33-1.</p>
<p>India</p>
<p> S.Somasundar run out			 9</p>
