<p> J.Srinath not out			   17</p>
<p> S.Joshi run out				2</p>
<p> A.Kumble c Hudson b Donald		 9</p>
<p> V.Prasad c Crookes b de Villiers	 0</p>
<p> Extras (b-5 lb-14 w-4)		    23</p>
